OL,3,GNEWSASea trout and salmon numbers
OL,4,Adeclining in rivers
OL,5,
OL,6,FFish counters monitoring the number of
OL,7,Fsea trout and salmon swimming up rivers
OL,8,Fin the north-east of England have been
OL,9,Frecording low numbers and are often not
OL,10,Foperational.
OL,12,FThe Environment Agency (EA) has
OL,13,Fcounters at the Tees, Wear and Tyne
OL,14,Frivers and the Tyne is the only river
OL,15,Fin England where the salmon stock is
OL,16,Fclassified as not at risk.
OL,18,FThe tracker in the River Wear has not
OL,19,Fbeen operational since the beginning of
OL,20,F2025 and a faulty counter in the River
OL,21,FTyne has meant readings for all but one
OL,22,Fmonth this year have been estimates.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
