OL,3,GNEWSASea trout and salmon numbers
OL,4,Adeclining in rivers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe EA said it was "too early to draw
OL,7,Fconclusions" on the numbers of salmon
OL,8,Fand sea trout this year but continues
OL,9,Fto monitor the situation.
